-- strings
UnterminatedString: 2 token(s)
  in.zen:1:3 unterminated string literal: end of file before the closing quote
StringSpansLine   : 3 token(s)
  in.zen:1:3 unterminated string literal: a string literal does not span lines
UnknownEscape     : 2 token(s)
  in.zen:1:3 unknown escape sequence: the escapes are \n \t \r \v \f \0 \\ \' \"
UnterminatedEscape: 1 token(s)
  in.zen:1:3 unterminated escape sequence: end of file after the backslash
-- characters
UnterminatedChar  : 2 token(s)
  in.zen:1:3 unterminated character literal: end of file before the closing quote
CharSpansLine     : 3 token(s)
  in.zen:1:3 unterminated character literal: a character literal does not span lines
EmptyChar         : 2 token(s)
  in.zen:1:3 empty character literal: a character literal holds exactly one byte
CharTooLong       : 2 token(s)
  in.zen:1:3 a character literal holds exactly one byte; this one holds more
-- comments
UnterminatedComment: 2 token(s)
  in.zen:1:3 unterminated block comment: end of file before `*/`
-- numbers
LeadingZero       : 3 token(s)
  in.zen:1:3 a decimal literal has no leading zero, and Zen has no octal
FloatNeedsDigit   : 3 token(s)
  in.zen:1:5 a float literal needs a digit after the `.`
SuffixOnNumber    : 3 token(s)
  in.zen:1:4 an identifier may not start with a digit, and a number carries no suffix
IntegerOutOfRange : 2 token(s)
  in.zen:1:3 integer literal out of range: the widest integer type is u64
-- names and bytes
UnknownAtName     : 2 token(s)
  in.zen:1:3 the `@` namespace is exactly `@Self`, `@meta`, `@scope`
StrayByte         : 3 token(s)
  in.zen:1:3 unexpected character: it begins no Zen token
StrayByte, one run: 3 token(s)
  in.zen:1:3 unexpected character: it begins no Zen token
MisplacedBom      : 2 token(s)
  in.zen:1:3 a byte-order mark is stripped only at the start of a file
-- a bom at offset 0 is stripped, and is not a fault
stripped at 0     : 2 token(s)
-- several mistakes in one file, all of them reported
three faults      : 2 token(s)
  in.zen:1:1 a decimal literal has no leading zero, and Zen has no octal
  in.zen:1:5 the `@` namespace is exactly `@Self`, `@meta`, `@scope`
  in.zen:1:10 unexpected character: it begins no Zen token
